# Facts about Mr Grimsby.

@fact grimsby.books
tier: surface
text: Keeps the village bookshop. He will find anything except what you came in for.

@fact grimsby.wrong
tier: personal
hint: Ask him for a book, and take what he gives you.
unlock: seen(grimsby_intro) > 0
text: The book he gives you instead is, more often than not, the one you needed.

@fact grimsby.parcels
tier: personal
hint: Some students get post from the bookshop.
unlock: seen(grimsby_parcel) > 0
text: He posts books to students he thinks need them, on credit, and has never once chased a debt.

@fact grimsby.lighthouses
tier: personal
hint: Ask where he goes when the shop is shut.
unlock: seen(grimsby_mind_the_shop) > 0
text: He has a weakness for lighthouses, and when he closes the shop, it is usually to go and look at one.

@fact grimsby.nose
tier: personal
hint: Let him choose for you, eyes shut.
unlock: seen(grimsbys_by_the_nose) > 0
text: He finds a book by its smell. The right book, he says, smells right.

@fact grimsby.upper_floor
tier: personal
hint: Climb the ladder at the back of the shop.
unlock: seen(grimsbys_upper_floor) > 0
text: Above the shop is a floor of remainders nobody mentions, up a ladder whose third and fourth rungs break.
